{"language":"jp","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","火力全开"],["/skills/0/name_i18n/jp","火力全開"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","为累计造成伤害最高的友军提升攻击力和急速。"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/jp","合計与ダメージが最も高い味方の攻撃力と速度がUP"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，备战时呼金会在自身位置摆放锻造台，并在战斗中总是会前往锻造台所在位置普通攻击和释放技能；主动释放时，为累计造成伤害最高的友军锻造机械齿轮，使其攻击力提升，提升值等同于呼金6% + 1%的基础攻击力，且急速提高80点，持续10秒。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/jp","パッシブ効果：戦闘準備時、自身の位置に作業台を設置。戦闘中、自身は常に作業台の位置から通常攻撃とスキル発動を行う。アクティブ効果：合計与ダメージが最も高い味方のために機械ギアを鍛造し、10秒間、対象の攻撃力がフーキンの基礎攻撃力の6% + 1%分UP、速度+80"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":91,"end":96,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":117,"end":122,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至7% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/jp","攻撃力上昇量が7% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至8% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/jp","攻撃力上昇量が8% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升至9% + 1%。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/jp","攻撃力上昇量が9% + 1%にUP"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":13,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/jp",[{"start":9,"end":14,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","攻击力提升